# Localized calendar — Node-safe barrel vs UI subpaths

Package: `@app-tour/localized-calendar`.

## Problem

Denali wizard **validation** is a Node path. `denali.plugin` → `denaliWizardHostHooks` → `denali-wizard-validation` → `denali-schedule-date-policy` → `ui/adapters/calendar-format` → `@app-tour/localized-calendar`.

If the package **root barrel** (`"."` / `src/index.ts`) re-exports `LocalizedDatePicker` / `SolarHijriCalendar`, Node loads `ui-primitives` `Button.js`, which `require()`s `Button.module.css`. `tsx` then throws `SyntaxError: Unexpected token '.'` and `@apps/api` never listens.

Wizard schedule min-date helpers (`todayIsoDate`, `compareIsoDates`, `addIsoDateDays`) are pure ISO math. They must not pull CSS modules. Client pickers import `@app-tour/localized-calendar/localized-date-picker`. Denali UI tsc uses `moduleResolution: bundler`. Plugin tsc stays `Node` and loads UI only via `importUiSurface(string)` so it does not typecheck CSS modules.

## Decision

Split the public graph:

| Import | Allowed in | Contents |
| ------ | ---------- | -------- |
| `@app-tour/localized-calendar` (root) | Node + UI | `jalaali-calendar`, `calendar-format`, `calendar-date-policy`, `i18n-format` only. No `.tsx`. No `@app-tour/ui-primitives`. |
| `@app-tour/localized-calendar/localized-date-picker` | Client UI | `LocalizedDatePicker`. Denali `tsconfig.ui.json` uses `moduleResolution: bundler` plus `paths` to `dist/` because plugin `moduleResolution: Node` cannot consume package `exports`. |
| `@app-tour/localized-calendar/solar-hijri-calendar` | Client UI | `SolarHijriCalendar` |
| `@app-tour/localized-calendar/calendar-format` | Node + UI | ISO/Jalali format helpers (explicit subpath; same symbols as root) |
| `@app-tour/localized-calendar/jalaali-calendar` | Node + UI | Intl Jalali ↔ Gregorian |

```text
API boot
  denali.plugin
    wizardHost.validate*
      denali-schedule-date-policy
        adapters/calendar-format
          @app-tour/localized-calendar          # Node-safe
          @app-tour/localized-calendar/calendar-format

Portal / Denali intake (client)
  DenaliIntakeBirthDateField / member profile
    @app-tour/localized-calendar/localized-date-picker
      ui-primitives/button + CSS modules        # webpack / Next only
```

Storage contract unchanged: Gregorian ISO `YYYY-MM-DD` (INV-DENALI-CAL-01). Jalali is presentation only.

## Out of scope

- Changing ISO persistence in `apps/api` / `platform-core`
- Moving wizard validation off `denali-schedule-date-policy`

## Verify

```bash
# Root barrel has no React picker / ui-primitives
rg 'localized-date-picker|solar-hijri|ui-primitives' packages/localized-calendar/src/index.ts
# expect empty

pnpm --filter @app-tour/localized-calendar exec node --import tsx --test \
  test/package-neutrality.spec.ts \
  test/calendar-format.spec.ts \
  test/jalaali-calendar.spec.ts

# API must boot without CSS parse
pnpm --filter @apps/api run dev
# expect: "@apps/api listening"
```
